{
"i": 55,
"where": "スライド6",
"en": "Parameter Conventions:Microsoft “x64” ABI",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 56,
"where": "スライド6",
"en": "First 4 parameters (from left to right) are put into RCX, RDX, R8, R9 respectively",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 57,
"where": "スライド6",
"en": "Remaining parameters “pushed” onto the stack so that the left-most parameter is at the lowest address",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 58,
"where": "ノート6",
"en": "Colon notation means the full value is represented by the concatenation of the two values.",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 59,
"where": "ノート6",
"en": "If rdx = 0x11112222 and eax = 0x33334444, then rdx:eax is the quadword 0x1111222233334444",
